  "description": "After suffering both scam and divorce, Chu Minsik teeters on the edge of financial ruin. Still, he doesn't let it completely ruin his humanity - a fact soon rewarded when the old man he helps out turns out to be more than meets the eye. Minsik is rewarded for his help, being told that the key to his future lies within his dreams... Specifically, dreams where he dates oh-so-sexy women! Each dream is guaranteed to tell him which crypto he should invest in the next day, turning him into somewhat of an overnight success! Money, fame, and women - what more could a guy want!\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
